12	 * the new owner's business day (counted by registrationDate equal to the effective, business-day
13	 * adjusted registration date resolved by {@link ResolveRegistrationDate}), so the create endpoint
14	 * responds 429 instead of exceeding the daily sign-up cap. Runs after {@link ResolveRegistrationDate}
15	 * (which publishes the adjusted date) and before {@link BuildOwner}.
